host_about:
I love to travel! Including in my own country and city. And I love to show other people how Lisbon is one of the most beautiful cities in the world!

I cannot live without:
a new country visited once in a while;
a roadtrip every year;
a great book all the time;
a good wine with friends;
and world food!

Please check my blog on traveling (in portuguese): http://viagens-de-aquem-e-alem-tejo.blogspot.pt.

- Born in 1984;
- From Coimbra district;
- Graduated in Law (2022) and in Classical Studies (2007).

